	YinEmperor: {
		DisplayName: Yin Emperor

		Dialog: {
			Intro: The Yin Emperor descends. Kneel, mortal — your soul is summoned to judgment.
			ActI: Rite of Fengdu. Let the nether decree be inscribed upon you.
			ActII: You are bound within the Soul-Quelling Prison. Shatter the Ghost Gate Lock, or be sealed forever.
			ActIII: Imperial Verdict! There is no appeal before the throne of the dead.
			SoulSeal: The seal contracts. Break the lock to escape!
			SealBroken: Impudent... you tore the gate from its hinges.
			YinYang: Edict of Fengdu — stand within the favored half, or your soul shall burn.
			FinalDecree: The Final Decree is written. Witness it.
			Phantom: So you reach the end. Behold the Seal of the Yin Sovereign.
			ExecutePrompt: The Fengdu regalia answers — strike now to execute the decree!
			Executed: Impossible... the verdict... turned upon me...
		}
	}

